{"path":"io/basic_osyncstream/get_wrapped","title":"std::basic_osyncstream<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::get_wrapped","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_osyncstream&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>get_wrapped","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/get_wrapped","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a pointer to the wrapped std::basic_streambuf, obtained by calling get_wrapped() on the underlying std::basic_syncbuf.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">streambuf_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> get_wrapped<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a pointer to the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\">std::basic_streambuf</a></span>, obtained by calling <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf/get_wrapped\"><code>get_wrapped()</code></a> on the underlying <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_syncbuf</span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Wrapped buffer can be safely wrapped again in a different synchronized output stream.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;syncstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2667\">std::<span class=\"me2\">osyncstream</span></span></a> bout1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    bout1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Hello, \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2667\">std::<span class=\"me2\">osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>bout1.<span class=\"me1\">get_wrapped</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Goodbye, \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Planet!\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"co1\">// emits the contents of the temporary buffer</span>\n    bout1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"World!\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"co1\">// emits the contents of bout1</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Goodbye, Planet!\nHello, World!</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/~basic_osyncstream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys the <code>basic_osyncstream</code> and emits its internal buffer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf/get_wrapped\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get_wrapped</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  retrieves the wrapped streambuf pointer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_syncbuf&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_osyncstream","title":"std::basic_osyncstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_osyncstream<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::get_wrapped","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns a pointer to the wrapped std::basic_streambuf, obtained by calling get_wrapped() on the underlying…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example","note":"Wrapped buffer can be safely wrapped again in a different synchronized output stream."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destroys the basic_osyncstream and emits its internal buffer"},{"label":"get_wrapped","note":"retrieves the wrapped streambuf pointer"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":108,"codeBlockCount":2}
